{
    "word": "unless",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "c0171ebe-ce82-371d-b3cb-e3dda52a3218",
                "word": "unless",
                "pos": "conj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "374c7913-8488-3344-bedb-e3bfe756e1ea",
                        "entry_id": "c0171ebe-ce82-371d-b3cb-e3dda52a3218",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Except on a specified condition; if not."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "33bc3f5e-46f9-4834-a42c-12f6c54b6189",
                                "sense_id": "374c7913-8488-3344-bedb-e3bfe756e1ea",
                                "text": "I’m leaving unless I get a pay rise."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae32d1bb-6ed2-4b79-b63b-406af392b896",
                                "sense_id": "374c7913-8488-3344-bedb-e3bfe756e1ea",
                                "text": "You can't go out unless it stops raining."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bbdc121-1b65-40f9-9a90-d3d97e886598",
                                "sense_id": "374c7913-8488-3344-bedb-e3bfe756e1ea",
                                "text": "Unless part of the staff, you are not allowed beyond this point."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "101de1e0-f3ac-4123-abb7-bb067017fb29",
                                "sense_id": "374c7913-8488-3344-bedb-e3bfe756e1ea",
                                "text": "Secondly, When a body is once in motion it will continue to move forever, unless something stops it. When a ball is struck on the surface of the earth, the friction of the earth and the resistance of the air soon stop its motion."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0b01e58-bf2c-499a-aef0-a34ca002396e",
                                "sense_id": "374c7913-8488-3344-bedb-e3bfe756e1ea",
                                "text": "Unless someone like you...cares a whole awful lot...nothing is going to get better...It's not."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6784e771-b2e2-30a4-810c-228a6424d8a5",
                        "entry_id": "c0171ebe-ce82-371d-b3cb-e3dda52a3218",
                        "glosses": [
                            "If not; used with counterfactual conditionals."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "55738839-fae9-41f9-aa4b-c0e0522b0c8b",
                                "sense_id": "6784e771-b2e2-30a4-810c-228a6424d8a5",
                                "text": "Who would know of Alexander or Caesar, or would respect the Stoics or the Peripatetics, unless they had been distinguished by the memorials of writers?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a8caac0d-2496-4185-a85b-e00d1ae81c4c",
                                "sense_id": "6784e771-b2e2-30a4-810c-228a6424d8a5",
                                "text": "And Joab said, As God liveth, unless thou hadst spoken, surely then in the morning the people had gone up every one from following his brother."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f85b96a6-73ee-41a8-b300-ffa3bb373d29",
                                "sense_id": "6784e771-b2e2-30a4-810c-228a6424d8a5",
                                "text": "Unless He were omnipotent, we could not be sure of His ability to bless us."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "46c0b387-8db7-3cca-9794-6f269bee9bdf",
                        "entry_id": "c0171ebe-ce82-371d-b3cb-e3dda52a3218",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Except if; used with hypothetical conditionals."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9960322e-deaf-4bfd-8aab-4d464beab9ca",
                                "sense_id": "46c0b387-8db7-3cca-9794-6f269bee9bdf",
                                "text": "Q. If Lieutenant P. had given the word \"Fire,\" would you have fired, and at what?—A. I should not have known, unless he had told me what to fire at."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c69facfa-c8d0-4562-905d-42a1268893e5",
                                "sense_id": "46c0b387-8db7-3cca-9794-6f269bee9bdf",
                                "text": "Lie down and finish out the night, since you are here; but, for heaven's sake! don't repeat that horrid noise: nothing could excuse it, unless you were having your throat cut!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "523cc98e-5c24-4c5d-aa60-a8480191e9c2",
                                "sense_id": "46c0b387-8db7-3cca-9794-6f269bee9bdf",
                                "text": "Suppose Breugel had done the whole painting with no legs. Then, titled as it is, it would be mystifying, unless someone were to say: the boy has fallen in the waters and they have closed over him, calm is restored, life goes on (as in The Israelites Crossing the Red Sea)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eb5ab61e-77fc-4152-a535-911994c55c5b",
                        "source_entry_id": "c0171ebe-ce82-371d-b3cb-e3dda52a3218",
                        "source_sense_description": "except on a specified condition",
                        "target_lang_word": "dokud ne",
